    "name": "Maren Ashveld",
    "role": "Proprietor of the Ashen Flagon",
    "faction": "Warden's Guild (Retired)",
    "personality": "Practical, observant, direct, and quietly protective of her tavern. She doesn't suffer fools.",
    "goals": "Keep the Ashen Flagon running smoothly, keep track of who comes and goes, and stay out of active field work.",
    "location": "The Ashen Flagon, Greyhold"
