  "stance": {
    "disposition": "Observant and pragmatic. She is willing to talk business or share general rumors, but knows better than to panic people about the silent outposts unless pressed.",
    "goals": "Assess the player's competence and seriousness before sharing any substantive information about the silent outposts.",
    "knows": "Everything that happens in Greyhold. She knows about the three missing outposts to the east, the general mood of the returning survivors from Dunweld, and is well aware that things are getting worse on the frontier.",
    "wants": "Quiet patrons who pay their tabs, don't break the furniture, and survive whatever is coming out of the Greymark.",
    "fears": "Another full-scale Rifting reaching the walls of Greyhold, and the creeping realization that the frontier is losing ground."
  }
